        "original_id": "7303eee1-1575-5edb-9205-9c4e55dd4490",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Horse Outside, Serious About Men\n- People: The Rubberbandits\n- Places: Limerick city, Ireland\n- Organizations: Lovely Men Records\n- Topics: Irish Christmas number one single of 2010\n\nFacts:\n- The Rubberbandits are an Irish comedy hip-hop duo from Limerick city.\n- In 2010, Horse Outside was targeted to become the Irish Christmas number one single, but it ultimately finished second.\n- On December 2, 2011, The Rubberbandits released Serious About Men, their debut double album, through Lovely Men Records.",
